{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"call@15452","snapshotName":"after@call@15452","pageId":"page@b0d04129d368ecaa701b8a9f4ab6d246","frameId":"frame@2df4bc428c602a34604ffd251e6e1b00","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:7483/#/parametri-multipaziente","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"it"},["HEAD",{},[[19,0]],[[19,1]],[[19,2]],[[19,3]],[[19,4]],[[19,5]],[[19,6]],[[19,7]],[[19,8]],[[19,9]],[[19,10]],[[19,11]],[[19,12]],[[19,13]],[[19,15]],[[19,16]],[[19,18]],[[19,20]],[[19,22]],[[19,24]],[[19,26]],[[19,28]],[[16,1]],[[16,3]],[[16,5]],[[16,7]],[[16,9]],[[16,11]],[[16,13]],[[15,1]],[[15,3]],[[15,5]],[[15,7]],[[15,9]],[[15,11]],[[15,13]],[[15,15]],[[14,1]],[[14,3]],[[14,5]],[[14,7]],[[14,9]],[[14,11]],[[14,13]],[[14,15]],[[14,17]],[[14,19]],[[14,21]],[[14,23]],[[14,25]],[[14,27]],[[13,1]],[[13,3]],[[7,1]],[[7,3]],[[7,5]],[[7,7]],[[6,1]],[[6,3]],[[6,5]],[[6,7]],[[4,1]],[[4,3]],[[4,5]],[[4,7]],[[4,9]],[[4,11]],[[4,13]],[[4,15]],["STYLE",{},"/* Ricerca in anagrafica AIFA. Token del design system; nessun rosso come colore di marca. */\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  padding: 16px 20px 20px;\r\n  min-height: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__campo {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  padding: 8px 12px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Stesso vincolo del campo nella maschera terapia: senza, il flex stira l'icona a tutto campo. */\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__campo > svg {\r\n  flex: none;\r\n  width: 18px;\r\n  height: 18px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__campo:focus-within {\r\n  border-color: var(--blue);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgb(47 107 237 / 12%);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__campo input {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  outline: none;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__criterio {\r\n  width: fit-content;\r\n  max-width: 100%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__esiti {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  min-height: 0;\r\n  overflow: auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__nota {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__nota--errore {\r\n  color: var(--red);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__lista {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  list-style: none;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__riga {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  padding: 10px 12px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__nome {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Il rosso qui e' corretto: e' un avviso, non un accento di marca. */\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__revocato {\r\n  margin-left: 8px;\r\n  padding: 1px 7px;\r\n  border-radius: 999px;\r\n  background: var(--red);\r\n  font-size: 10px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__dettagli,\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__pa {\r\n  margin: 2px 0 0;\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── Modale ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco-modale {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  width: min(720px, 96vw);\r\n  max-height: 88vh;\r\n  max-width: none;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco-modale__testa {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n  padding: 18px 20px 12px;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.ricerca-farmaco-modale__testa h2 {\r\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\r\n  font-size: 16px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── Pagina dedicata ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\r\n\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci {\r\n  max-width: 1400px;\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci__corpo {\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--card-radius, 14px);\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── Indicatore sulla riga di terapia ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\r\n\r\n.farmaco-trovato {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  margin: 3px 0 0 6px;\r\n  padding: 2px 6px;\r\n  border-radius: 999px;\r\n  background: var(--emerald-bg);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  line-height: 1.4;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  vertical-align: middle;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.farmaco-trovato svg {\r\n  display: block;\r\n  width: 12px;\r\n  height: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--teal);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* \"non in anagrafica\" / \"senza documento\": ds-badge--warning canonico (ambra, mai rosso: non è\r\n   un allarme clinico ma un dato mancante su cui l'operatore può agire). */\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__icona {\r\n  flex: none;\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  place-items: center;\r\n  width: 24px;\r\n  height: 24px;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__icona svg {\r\n  width: 20px;\r\n  height: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.ricerca-farmaco__testo {\r\n  /* Base esplicita: su schermi stretti è il pulsante ad andare a capo, non le parole a spezzarsi. */\r\n  flex: 1 1 200px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  overflow-wrap: break-word;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\r\n  .ricerca-farmaco__riga {\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  }\r\n  .ricerca-farmaco__riga > :last-child {\r\n    margin-left: 36px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},"/* Farmaci — HMI 1 (artifacts/hmi-parity/proto/farmaci.png). Solo la pagina: la modale della\r\n   terapia usa lo stesso corpo di ricerca con i suoi stili. */\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci {\r\n  max-width: none;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci__corpo {\r\n  border-radius: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco {\r\n  padding: 24px;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__campo {\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  padding: 0 16px;\r\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: #f5f7fb;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__campo input {\r\n  font-size: 16px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__nota {\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  line-height: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__vuoto {\r\n  padding: 16px 0;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__esiti {\r\n  overflow: visible;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__lista {\r\n  gap: 0;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__riga {\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n  padding: 12px 0;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 0;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__nome {\r\n  font: 600 16px/24px var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__dettagli,\r\n.page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__pa {\r\n  font: 400 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\r\n  .page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco {\r\n    padding: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n  .page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__riga {\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  }\r\n  .page-anagrafica-farmaci .ricerca-farmaco__riga > :last-child {\r\n    margin-left: 40px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]],[[19,30]],[[1,8]]],"viewport":{"width":853,"height":1138},"timestamp":71863.557,"wallTime":1792890302469,"collectionTime":1,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
